# Layer 4 of docs/level-5-enforcement.md: files that set the rules of the game.
# The main-protection ruleset requires a code owner's approval for any PR that changes them.
# A line with several owners needs one approval from any of them, and an author cannot
# approve their own PR, so with two owners each one reviews the other's changes.
# Owners must have write access to the repo, or GitHub ignores them.
# When several lines match a file, the last one wins.

